    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f4ef2fbbc60d420249854af93c628955ad8fe84af23cd225e255bd15cd32982b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n数了三遍，三遍都不一样！\n一袋只装十个。\n四个十就是四十！\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
